# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A managed workflow works like a Python function that runs on remote compute. Compare a local function with the same code as a workflow:\n"
msgstr "Managed workflow bekerja seperti fungsi Python yang berjalan di compute jarak jauh. Bandingkan fungsi lokal dengan kode yang sama sebagai workflow:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`Local Python`**\n"
msgstr "**`Local Python`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In a managed workflow, `run()` is the call, `get_arguments()` gives the workflow its parameters, and `save_result()` is its `return` statement. Because the workflow runs as a separate job on remote compute, it differs from a local function call in three ways:\n"
msgstr "Di managed workflow, `run()` adalah pemanggilnya, `get_arguments()` memberi workflow parameternya, dan `save_result()` adalah pernyataan `return`-nya. Karena workflow berjalan sebagai job terpisah di compute jarak jauh, ia berbeda dari pemanggilan fungsi lokal dalam tiga hal:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The client encodes arguments and results.** Each value must be one that the client can encode, and some types change. See [Read arguments in your workflow](#read-arguments-in-your-workflow).\n"
msgstr "**Client meng-encode argumen dan hasil.** Setiap nilai harus berupa nilai yang bisa di-encode oleh client, dan beberapa tipe berubah. Lihat [Baca argumen di workflow-mu](#read-arguments-in-your-workflow).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The call does not wait.** `run()` returns a job immediately, and you read the result later with `job.result()`. See [Save results](#save-results).\n"
msgstr "**Pemanggilan tidak menunggu.** `run()` langsung mengembalikan job, dan kamu membaca hasilnya nanti dengan `job.result()`. Lihat [Simpan hasil](#save-results).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Nothing checks the call.** A Python function rejects an unknown keyword argument, but a workflow ignores it unless you attach a schema. See [Best practice: validate arguments with a schema](#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema).\n"
msgstr "**Tidak ada yang memeriksa pemanggilan.** Fungsi Python menolak keyword argument yang tidak dikenal, tetapi workflow mengabaikannya kecuali kamu memasang schema. Lihat [Praktik terbaik: validasi argumen dengan schema](#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema).\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Your local notebook, run_workflow_remotely.ipynb, calls run(args). A workflow runs an optional schema check, then creates the managed workflow job, source_files/my_workflow.py. The job reads its arguments with get_arguments(), runs your code, such as mapping, transpiling circuits, running primitives, and post-processing, and returns a result with save_result(). A workflow stores the result, and your notebook reads it with job.result().](/docs/images/managed-workflows/inputs-outputs.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Your local notebook, run_workflow_remotely.ipynb, calls run(args). A workflow runs an optional schema check, then creates the managed workflow job, source_files/my_workflow.py. The job reads its arguments with get_arguments(), runs your code, such as mapping, transpiling circuits, running primitives, and post-processing, and returns a result with save_result(). A workflow stores the result, and your notebook reads it with job.result().](/docs/images/managed-workflows/inputs-outputs.svg)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Read arguments in your workflow {#read-arguments-in-your-workflow}"
msgstr "Baca argumen di workflow-mu {#read-arguments-in-your-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pass inputs to your workflow from your local notebook:\n"
msgstr "Kirim input ke workflow-mu dari notebook lokalmu:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To enable this, edit your workflow code to fetch arguments with `get_arguments()`, which returns a dictionary whose keys are the argument names:\n"
msgstr "Agar ini berfungsi, ubah kode workflow-mu untuk mengambil argumen dengan `get_arguments()`, yang mengembalikan dictionary dengan nama argumen sebagai key:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`source_files/my_workflow.py`**\n"
msgstr "**`source_files/my_workflow.py`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The dictionary contains only the arguments that the run passed, so use `arguments.get()` with a default value for optional arguments. You can use any argument name except the protected keywords `config` and `function_size`, because `run()` uses these keywords directly. `run()` also rejects `compute_profile`. To choose compute resources, pass `function_size`.\n"
msgstr "Dictionary hanya berisi argumen yang diberikan oleh run, jadi gunakan `arguments.get()` dengan nilai default untuk argumen opsional. Kamu bisa memakai nama argumen apa pun kecuali keyword yang dilindungi `config` dan `function_size`, karena `run()` memakai keyword ini secara langsung. `run()` juga menolak `compute_profile`. Untuk memilih resource compute, berikan `function_size`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To read the size that the job runs at, call `get_function_size()` in your workflow code:\n"
msgstr "Untuk membaca ukuran yang dipakai job saat berjalan, panggil `get_function_size()` di kode workflow-mu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the run does not pass `function_size`, `get_function_size()` returns the workflow's default size. See [Choose a size for each run](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles#choose-a-size-for-each-run).\n"
msgstr "Kalau run tidak memberikan `function_size`, `get_function_size()` mengembalikan ukuran default workflow. Lihat [Pilih ukuran untuk setiap run](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles#choose-a-size-for-each-run).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported argument types {#supported-argument-types}"
msgstr "Tipe argumen yang didukung {#supported-argument-types}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each value must be JSON-serializable, or an object that the client can encode, such as a Qiskit circuit or a NumPy array. Because the client encodes each argument before it sends the job and `get_arguments()` decodes it inside the workflow, the workflow receives the original Python object.\n"
msgstr "Setiap nilai harus bisa di-serialisasi ke JSON, atau berupa objek yang bisa di-encode oleh client, seperti circuit Qiskit atau array NumPy. Karena client meng-encode setiap argumen sebelum mengirim job dan `get_arguments()` men-decode-nya di dalam workflow, workflow menerima objek Python aslinya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The client sends `int`, `float`, `str`, `bool`, `None`, and lists or dictionaries of these unchanged. It encodes other objects, such as a `QuantumCircuit`, a `numpy.ndarray`, or a `complex` number, as a dictionary with a `__type__` tag and a `__value__`. You need this form when you [write an argument schema](#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema).\n"
msgstr "Client mengirim `int`, `float`, `str`, `bool`, `None`, serta list atau dictionary dari tipe-tipe ini tanpa perubahan. Objek lain, seperti `QuantumCircuit`, `numpy.ndarray`, atau bilangan `complex`, di-encode sebagai dictionary dengan tag `__type__` dan `__value__`. Kamu membutuhkan bentuk ini saat [menulis schema argumen](#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because JSON has no equivalent for some types, these types change during encoding. Tuples arrive as lists, dictionary keys arrive as strings, and NumPy integers such as `np.int64` arrive as `int`. If the client cannot encode a value, such as `bytes` or `np.float32`, `run()` raises a `TypeError` and does not create a job.\n"
msgstr "Karena JSON tidak punya padanan untuk beberapa tipe, tipe-tipe ini berubah saat di-encode. Tuple tiba sebagai list, key dictionary tiba sebagai string, dan integer NumPy seperti `np.int64` tiba sebagai `int`. Kalau client tidak bisa meng-encode sebuah nilai, seperti `bytes` atau `np.float32`, `run()` memunculkan `TypeError` dan tidak membuat job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some objects cannot be passed as arguments. For example, pass a backend's name as a string instead of a `Backend` object, and create the backend inside the workflow. See [Run quantum jobs from a workflow](/guides/manage-quantum-classical-workflows).\n"
msgstr "Beberapa objek tidak bisa diberikan sebagai argumen. Misalnya, berikan nama backend sebagai string, bukan objek `Backend`, dan buat backend-nya di dalam workflow. Lihat [Jalankan job kuantum dari workflow](/guides/manage-quantum-classical-workflows).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Size limits {#size-limits}"
msgstr "Batas ukuran {#size-limits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The arguments of one run can be up to 32 MB after encoding. For example, one 100-qubit circuit with a depth of 100 encodes to about 39 KB, so a single run can take a batch of about 800 such circuits. For larger inputs, [upload a file](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) and pass its name as an argument.\n"
msgstr "Argumen untuk satu run bisa sampai 32 MB setelah di-encode. Misalnya, satu circuit 100-qubit dengan depth 100 di-encode menjadi sekitar 39 KB, sehingga satu run bisa menerima batch sekitar 800 circuit seperti itu. Untuk input yang lebih besar, [unggah file](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) dan berikan namanya sebagai argumen.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* REVIEW: 32 MB is MAX_ARGUMENTS_LENGTH_MB, which is checked when the workflow declares a schema. The 50 MB request body limit applies to every run. Confirm the number to publish. */}\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save results {#save-results}"
msgstr "Simpan hasil {#save-results}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `save_result()` at the end of your workflow to return a result to your notebook. Read the result in your notebook with `job.result()`:\n"
msgstr "Gunakan `save_result()` di akhir workflow-mu untuk mengembalikan hasil ke notebook-mu. Baca hasilnya di notebook dengan `job.result()`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To enable this, call `save_result()` in your workflow code:\n"
msgstr "Agar ini berfungsi, panggil `save_result()` di kode workflow-mu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`save_result()` encodes the result in the same way that the client encodes arguments, and `job.result()` decodes it. A result can therefore contain the [supported argument types](#supported-argument-types), such as circuits, NumPy arrays, and the result of a primitive job, with the same type changes.\n"
msgstr "`save_result()` meng-encode hasil dengan cara yang sama seperti client meng-encode argumen, dan `job.result()` men-decode-nya. Jadi hasil bisa berisi [tipe argumen yang didukung](#supported-argument-types), seperti circuit, array NumPy, dan hasil dari primitive job, dengan perubahan tipe yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Check the return value.** If `save_result()` cannot encode the value, it logs a warning and returns `False` instead of raising an error. Without a check, the job can end with the `DONE` status and no result.\n"
msgstr "**Periksa nilai kembaliannya.** Kalau `save_result()` tidak bisa meng-encode nilainya, ia mencatat warning dan mengembalikan `False`, bukan memunculkan error. Tanpa pemeriksaan, job bisa berakhir dengan status `DONE` tanpa hasil.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Only the last `save_result()` is stored.** Each call replaces the saved result. To return several values, save them in one dictionary, or write them to the logs.\n"
msgstr "**Hanya `save_result()` yang terakhir yang disimpan.** Setiap pemanggilan menggantikan hasil yang tersimpan. Untuk mengembalikan beberapa nilai, simpan dalam satu dictionary, atau tulis ke log.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**An empty dictionary means no result.** If the workflow never calls `save_result()`, `job.result()` returns `{}`.\n"
msgstr "**Dictionary kosong berarti tidak ada hasil.** Kalau workflow tidak pernah memanggil `save_result()`, `job.result()` mengembalikan `{}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To return files, such as large arrays or plots, save them to [file storage](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) and return their names in the result.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengembalikan file, seperti array besar atau plot, simpan ke [penyimpanan file](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) dan kembalikan namanya di hasil.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best practice: validate arguments with a schema {#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema}"
msgstr "Praktik terbaik: validasi argumen dengan schema {#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As a best practice, attach a [JSON Schema](https://json-schema.org/) to every workflow that takes arguments. The schema describes the arguments that the workflow accepts, and the workflow checks the arguments of every run against it before it creates the job. If the arguments do not match, `run()` fails immediately with an error that names the bad field, and the workflow does not create a job. Without a schema, bad arguments reach the workflow after the job starts, and the workflow ignores a misspelled argument name.\n"
msgstr "Sebagai praktik terbaik, pasang [JSON Schema](https://json-schema.org/) ke setiap workflow yang menerima argumen. Schema menjelaskan argumen yang diterima workflow, dan workflow memeriksa argumen setiap run terhadapnya sebelum membuat job. Kalau argumen tidak cocok, `run()` langsung gagal dengan error yang menyebut field yang salah, dan workflow tidak membuat job. Tanpa schema, argumen yang salah baru sampai ke workflow setelah job dimulai, dan workflow mengabaikan nama argumen yang salah eja.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set the schema with `arguments_schema` when you upload the workflow. Pass a dictionary, not a JSON string:\n"
msgstr "Atur schema dengan `arguments_schema` saat kamu mengunggah workflow. Berikan dictionary, bukan string JSON:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keep the following points in mind when you write a schema:\n"
msgstr "Ingat poin-poin berikut saat menulis schema:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Describe the encoded form of Qiskit and NumPy objects.** The schema checks the arguments as the client sends them, so a circuit is an object such as `{\"__type__\": \"QuantumCircuit\", \"__value__\": \"<base64-encoded QPY>\"}`, not a string or an array. Check the `__type__` tag, and treat `__value__` as an opaque string. A schema that describes a circuit as a string rejects every valid run.\n"
msgstr "**Jelaskan bentuk ter-encode dari objek Qiskit dan NumPy.** Schema memeriksa argumen sebagaimana dikirim client, jadi sebuah circuit adalah objek seperti `{\"__type__\": \"QuantumCircuit\", \"__value__\": \"<base64-encoded QPY>\"}`, bukan string atau array. Periksa tag `__type__`, dan perlakukan `__value__` sebagai string buram. Schema yang menjelaskan circuit sebagai string akan menolak setiap run yang valid.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Set `\"additionalProperties\": false`.** Without this setting, the workflow ignores a misspelled argument name, such as `shotz`, without a warning, and runs with its default value. Declare every argument that the workflow accepts before you enable this setting.\n"
msgstr "**Atur `\"additionalProperties\": false`.** Tanpa pengaturan ini, workflow mengabaikan nama argumen yang salah eja, seperti `shotz`, tanpa peringatan, dan berjalan dengan nilai defaultnya. Deklarasikan setiap argumen yang diterima workflow sebelum kamu mengaktifkan pengaturan ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Mark arguments as required.** Add each argument that the workflow reads without a default value to `required`.\n"
msgstr "**Tandai argumen sebagai wajib.** Tambahkan setiap argumen yang dibaca workflow tanpa nilai default ke `required`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the arguments do not match the schema, the error message names the rule and the location of the bad value:\n"
msgstr "Kalau argumen tidak cocok dengan schema, pesan error menyebut aturan dan lokasi nilai yang salah:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A schema checks the type, shape, and range of each argument. A schema cannot check whether two valid arguments conflict, or whether a circuit fits a backend. Keep those checks in the workflow code.\n"
msgstr "Schema memeriksa tipe, bentuk, dan rentang setiap argumen. Schema tidak bisa memeriksa apakah dua argumen yang valid saling bertentangan, atau apakah sebuah circuit cocok dengan backend. Simpan pemeriksaan semacam itu di kode workflow.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update or remove a schema {#update-or-remove-a-schema}"
msgstr "Perbarui atau hapus schema {#update-or-remove-a-schema}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To replace the schema, set a new `arguments_schema` and upload the workflow again.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengganti schema, atur `arguments_schema` yang baru dan unggah workflow lagi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To remove the schema, upload the workflow with `arguments_schema={}`.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menghapus schema, unggah workflow dengan `arguments_schema={}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you upload the workflow without `arguments_schema`, the workflow keeps the stored schema.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu mengunggah workflow tanpa `arguments_schema`, workflow mempertahankan schema yang tersimpan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see the schema that is in effect, read `my_workflow.arguments_schema`. A value of `None` means that the workflow has no schema.\n"
msgstr "Untuk melihat schema yang sedang berlaku, baca `my_workflow.arguments_schema`. Nilai `None` berarti workflow tidak punya schema.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check arguments before you run {#check-arguments-before-you-run}"
msgstr "Periksa argumen sebelum menjalankan {#check-arguments-before-you-run}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Call `validate_arguments()` to check a set of arguments against the schema without starting a job:\n"
msgstr "Panggil `validate_arguments()` untuk memeriksa sekumpulan argumen terhadap schema tanpa memulai job:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the arguments are not valid, `validate_arguments()` raises a `QiskitServerlessException` with the same message that `run()` returns for those arguments. If the workflow has no schema, any arguments are valid. A valid result does not guarantee that `run()` succeeds, because `run()` also checks other limits, such as the number of active jobs.\n"
msgstr "Kalau argumen tidak valid, `validate_arguments()` memunculkan `QiskitServerlessException` dengan pesan yang sama seperti yang dikembalikan `run()` untuk argumen tersebut. Kalau workflow tidak punya schema, argumen apa pun valid. Hasil valid tidak menjamin `run()` berhasil, karena `run()` juga memeriksa batas lain, seperti jumlah job aktif.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schema rules {#schema-rules}"
msgstr "Aturan schema {#schema-rules}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A managed workflow rejects the upload if the schema breaks any of the following rules:\n"
msgstr "Managed workflow menolak unggahan kalau schema melanggar salah satu aturan berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The schema can be up to 64 KiB, with up to 64 levels of nesting and up to 200 subschemas.\n"
msgstr "Schema bisa berukuran sampai 64 KiB, dengan sampai 64 level nesting dan sampai 200 subschema.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "References must point inside the same schema, such as `#/$defs/circuit`, and every reference must resolve. References to URLs or files are not allowed.\n"
msgstr "Referensi harus menunjuk ke dalam schema yang sama, seperti `#/$defs/circuit`, dan setiap referensi harus bisa di-resolve. Referensi ke URL atau file tidak diizinkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The schema must be an object or a boolean.\n"
msgstr "Schema harus berupa objek atau boolean.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Also avoid the following problems, which the upload does not catch:\n"
msgstr "Hindari juga masalah berikut, yang tidak terdeteksi saat unggah:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Nested quantifiers in `pattern`.** A pattern such as `^(a+)+$` can take a very long time to evaluate. A workflow stops validation after a CPU time limit and rejects the run. Write patterns without a quantifier around a group that already contains one, such as `^ibm_[a-z0-9_]{1,40}$`.\n"
msgstr "**Quantifier bersarang di `pattern`.** Pola seperti `^(a+)+$` bisa memakan waktu sangat lama untuk dievaluasi. Workflow menghentikan validasi setelah batas waktu CPU dan menolak run. Tulis pola tanpa quantifier di sekitar grup yang sudah berisi quantifier, seperti `^ibm_[a-z0-9_]{1,40}$`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`false` as a schema.** The schema `false` rejects every run. To remove validation, use `{}`.\n"
msgstr "**`false` sebagai schema.** Schema `false` menolak setiap run. Untuk menghapus validasi, gunakan `{}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshoot a schema {#troubleshoot-a-schema}"
msgstr "Atasi masalah schema {#troubleshoot-a-schema}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Problem | Cause |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| Every run is rejected on a circuit argument. | The schema describes the circuit as a string or an array. Describe it as an object with a `__type__` tag. |\n"
"| Valid runs are rejected. | `additionalProperties` is `false`, and the schema does not declare an argument that the run passes. The error `path` names the argument. |\n"
"| Invalid runs are not rejected. | The workflow has no schema. Check `my_workflow.arguments_schema`. |\n"
"| No run is checked, although you set a schema. | The schema was passed as a JSON string. Pass a dictionary. |\n"
"| The upload fails with a `400` error. | The schema breaks one of the [schema rules](#schema-rules). |\n"
"| The error says that validation took too much CPU time. | A `pattern` has nested quantifiers. Rewrite the pattern. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Masalah | Penyebab |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| Setiap run ditolak pada argumen circuit. | Schema menjelaskan circuit sebagai string atau array. Jelaskan sebagai objek dengan tag `__type__`. |\n"
"| Run yang valid ditolak. | `additionalProperties` bernilai `false`, dan schema tidak mendeklarasikan argumen yang diberikan run. `path` pada error menyebut argumennya. |\n"
"| Run yang tidak valid tidak ditolak. | Workflow tidak punya schema. Periksa `my_workflow.arguments_schema`. |\n"
"| Tidak ada run yang diperiksa, padahal kamu sudah mengatur schema. | Schema diberikan sebagai string JSON. Berikan dictionary. |\n"
"| Unggahan gagal dengan error `400`. | Schema melanggar salah satu [aturan schema](#schema-rules). |\n"
"| Error menyebut validasi memakan terlalu banyak waktu CPU. | `pattern` punya quantifier bersarang. Tulis ulang polanya. |\n"
